目标函数的强凸性使最小解唯一；对任意只相差一个
观测的$s,s'\in Z^n$及任意$z\in Z$，算法满足
\[
 |\ell(A(s),z)-\ell(A(s'),z)|\leq\beta_n,
\]
并且其稳定性常数满足
\begin{equation}
 \beta_n\leq\frac{2L^2}{\lambda n}
 \label{eq:regularized-stability-bound}
\end{equation}
\end{theorem}

